Bad Keyboard Access - Accessibility Test

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .violation-section {
            border: 2px solid #d32f2f;
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #ffebee;
        }
        .violation-title {
            color: #d32f2f;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .interactive-example {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        .fake-button {
            background-color: #2196f3;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            margin: 5px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .fake-button:hover {
            background-color: #1976d2;
        }
        .clickable-div {
            background-color: #4caf50;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .clickable-div:hover {
            background-color: #45a049;
        }
        .custom-dropdown {
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .dropdown-trigger {
            background-color: #ff9800;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .dropdown-content {
            display: none;
            position: absolute;
            background-color: white;
            min-width: 200px;
            box-shadow: 0px 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .dropdown-content.show {
            display: block;
        }
        .dropdown-item {
            color: black;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .dropdown-item:hover {
            background-color: #f1f1f1;
        }
        .image-gallery {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .gallery-item {
            border: 2px solid #ddd;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }
        .gallery-item:hover {
            border-color: #2196f3;
            background-color: #e3f2fd;
        }
        .slider-container {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .custom-slider {
            width: 100%;
            height: 20px;
            background: #ddd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            position: relative;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .slider-thumb {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 30%;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            background: #2196f3;
            border-radius: 50%;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            z-index: 1000;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        .modal-content {
            background-color: white;
            margin: 15% auto;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #888;
            width: 300px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .close-modal {
            color: #aaa;
            float: right;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .close-modal:hover {
            color: black;
        }



    Bad Keyboard Access - Multiple WCAG 2.1.1 & 2.1.3 Violations
    This page demonstrates keyboard accessibility failures that prevent users from operating interactive elements using only a keyboard.



        VIOLATION 1: DIV elements styled as buttons

            File Management Interface
            Create Folder
            Upload File
            Delete Selected
            Share
            Problem: DIVs lack tabindex, role="button", and keyboard event handlers!

            Media Player Controls

                ⏪ Previous
                ▶️ Play
                ⏩ Next
                🔊 Volume

            Problem: Essential media controls are mouse-only!





        VIOLATION 2: Interactive images without keyboard support

            Product Gallery - Clickable Images


